    <string name="ln_shared_grant_title">Allow access to all files</string>
    <string name="ln_shared_grant_body">The shared folder sits at the top of your internal storage. Android only lets an app create a folder there — or read the files you copy into it — with this permission.

Without it there is no shared folder at all.

If you switch this off again later, Android force-closes Linux and the desktop restarts.</string>
